# Credentials must never be in this repository.
# v2 keeps them in ~/.skala-workbuddy/, outside the plugin; these patterns are a second line of defence.
**/config/config.json
**/config/*.local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets*

# Runtime data and logs
**/data/
**/output/
**/*.log
**/audit*.jsonl
docs/audit-*.md

# Private notes (publishing notes, internal docs)
_private/
PUBLISH.md

# Third-party server code must not be published here
**/perfex_saas/

# System
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
